.TH "AG\-CLI\-REPO\-CREATE" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-repo\-create \- Create a new repository
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli repo create <repo> | <owner>/<repo> [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Create a new repository on AtomGit.
.PP
\&Use repo to create the repository under your current account, or owner/repo to
\&create it under an explicitly specified user or organization namespace.
\&Pass \-\-public to make the repository public, or \-\-private for private.
\&If neither is specified, it defaults to private.
.PP
\&Pass \-\-clone to clone the repository locally after creation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-c, \-\-clone\fR
\&Clone the repository after creation
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-d, \-\-description <string>\fR
\&Description of the repository
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-private\fR
\&Make the repository private
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-public\fR
\&Make the repository public
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&# Create a new private repository under your account
\&  ag\-cli repo create my\-project
.PP
\&  # Create a public repository and clone it
\&  ag\-cli repo create my\-project \-\-public \-\-clone
.PP
\&  # Create a repository in an organization
\&  ag\-cli repo create my\-org/my\-project \-\-public
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBag\-cli\-repo\fR(1)
